{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026dQFD5PPDYY1793262290.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>行政長官李家超下午公開宏福苑大火獨立委員會報告，及交代跟進工作。香港財政司副司長黃偉綸表示，房屋局將進行改革，成立全新管制組，取代目前的獨立審查組。管制組會成立項目專責團隊，特別安排一位聯絡專員，主動聯繫每一個項目的業主立案法團，並積極推展建築物條例修例工作。</p><p></p><p><a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1203503-%E5%AE%8F%E7%A6%8F%E8%8B%91%E5%A0%B1%E5%91%8A%E5%85%A8%E9%9D%A2%E6%94%B9%E9%9D%A9%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E5%B1%80%E5%85%A7%E9%83%A8%E9%87%8D%E7%B5%84%E8%A8%AD%E5%85%AC%E7%87%9F%E6%88%BF%E5%B1%8B%E6%A8%93%E5%AE%87%E7%AE%A1%E5%88%B6%E7%B5%84%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">宏福苑報告‧全面改革｜房屋局內部重組　設公營房屋樓宇管制組｜一文看清</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:21:56.819818+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:15:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T00:38:06.555017+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:18:19.370517+00:00","content_hash":"1a2fcf4d7a0b7e0ca4b9c05989f805fa572b57d4e4130d13aeee5a599730e3fa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:21:56.819818+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}